,\\"reviewStatus\\",\\"reviewType\\",\\"scenes\\",\\"score\\",\\"sku\\",\\"startTime\\"],\\"returns\\":[\\"记录唯一标识\\",\\"标题\\",\\"类型\\",\\"评论内容\\",\\"itemId\\",\\"orderId\\",\\"content\\",\\"item Id\\",\\"seo Url\\",\\"images\\"],\\"isMutation\\":false,\\"requiredParams\\":[\\"X-SHOP-ID\\"],\\"paramHints\\":[{\\"param\\":\\"brand\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 品牌\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"complaintType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 客诉类型\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"countdown\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); 搜置倒计时\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"endTime\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64(毫秒级时间戳格式)); 结束时间-时间戳格式\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"frontCategoryId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64); 前台类目\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"isPublic\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=boolean; 公开状态\\",\\"example\\":\\"false\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"itemId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; itemId\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"orderId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 订单号，订单ID,订单编号\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"page\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); Page number\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"processStatus\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 客诉处理状态\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewMediaType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 评价的媒体类型\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewStatus\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 评价状态\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string(A_PREMIUM-主站，AMAZON-亚马逊); 评价所属的平台， A_PREMIUM-主站，AMAZON-亚马逊\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"scenes\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=array; 媒体上架场景\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"score\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); 星数\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"size\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); Page size\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"sku\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; SKU\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"startTime\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64(毫秒级时间戳格式)); 开始时间-时间戳格式\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"p