围1694409600000-1696905600000）  \\n   - 检查评论内容字段提取逻辑，确认是否存在解析错误  \\n   - 重点排查图片分隔符处理模块的异常\\n\\n2. **系统修复建议**  \\n   - 优化评论数据清洗流程，增加异常值检测机制  \\n   - 针对itemId 26686985452486736和44134727451820924进行专项检查\\n\\n3. **后续分析准备**  \\n   - 建议重新获取有效评论数据后再进行分析  \\n   - 增加数据质量校验环节，避免无效数据流入分析系统\\n\\n注：当前分析结果受限于数据异常，建议优先修复数据获取流程后再进行深度分析。","format":"markdown"}]}	success	[{"step": 1, "type": "intent", "output": {"intentClear": true, "bindToolsCap": {"tier": "recall", "after": 5, "before": 17, "source": "vector", "matches": [{"id": 18, "name": "S02S1123", "score": 0.3704, "source": "vector", "description": "编辑评价信息V2"}, {"id": 15, "name": "S02S1111", "score": 0.3703, "source": "vector", "description": "上传对应商品评价至google"}, {"id": 3, "name": "exportUpsAndItemByExcelUsingPOST", "score": 0.3606, "source": "vector", "description": "导出每日评论数据"}, {"id": 8, "name": "S02S1101", "score": 0.3462, "source": "vector", "description": "支持查询主站和亚马逊(AMAZON)的评论数据，按查询条件（时间、评分、商品/订单标识、评价状态等）分页获取商品评论列表，返回多条记录及评论 content。用于评论检索、统计与分析取数；单条详情或回复提交请用其他工具。"}, {"id": 9, "name": "getOperationLogsUsingGET", "score": 0.2778, "source": "vector", "description": "S02S1114 - 获取评论操作日志"}], "tierTopK": 5, "recallRequired": true}, "recallSource": "vector", "intentMatched": true, "recallMatches": [{"id": 1, "label": "评论模块", "score": 0.5263, "source": "vector"}], "scopeFromCache": true, "toolsAfterBindCap": 5, "matchedCategoryIds": [1], "includeUncategorized": false, "toolsAfterIntentNarrow": 17, "toolsBeforeIntentNarrow": 17}}, {"step": 2, "type": "route_plan", "output": {"route": "orchestrated_task", "method": "llm", "reason": "需要进行评论分析，需调用相关技能和工具", "skillSelect": "explicit", "routeFallback": false, "requestedSkillId": 1, "suggestedSkillId": 1, "availableSkillIds": [1, 2, 3], "allowHostToolSteps": false, "availableHostToolNames": ["fillReplyDraft"], "pageHostSkillCandidateId": 3}}, {"step": 3, "type": "plan", "output": {"goal": "帮我分析当前上下文的评论内容", "method": "template", "source": "llm", "stepIds": ["S02S1101", "analyze"], "taskPhas