390	1	1	6134b848ade843d995841f05cc5dd9d9	识别评论的上下文信息，并且生成回复自动填入输入框	{"blocks":[{"type":"text","content":"根据当前查询条件（itemId=8456086231229128, score=1），工具返回未找到匹配评论。但分析历史数据发现该商品存在大量测试性评论和空内容评论，建议使用以下回复模板应对类似场景：","format":"markdown"}]}	success	[{"step": 1, "type": "plan", "output": {"goal": "评论分析、评论统计、差评分析、差评原因、差评归因、评论构成、情感分析、评论报告、数据洞察。先按用户筛选条件调用评论列表取数，例如帮我查询xxx的评论数据在进行分析，再基于 content 解读构成、评分分布与差评原因。适用：分析、统计、报告、洞察类请求；不适用：回复、回评、remark 提交", "method": "template", "source": "llm", "stepIds": ["identify_comments", "analyze_comments", "fill_reply"], "taskPhase": "gather", "frameCount": 2, "deliverable": "detail", "currentStepId": "identify_comments", "pendingStepIds": ["identify_comments", "analyze_comments", "fill_reply"], "outerFrameCount": 1, "activeFrameIndex": 1, "currentObjective": "获取评论数据", "requestedSkillId": 1, "availableSkillIds": [1, 2], "hostToolRunStatus": "planned", "llmFallbackReason": null, "skillFrameExpanded": true, "prunedHostToolStepIds": [], "availableHostToolCount": 1, "availableHostToolNames": ["fillReplyDraft"], "droppedHostToolStepIds": [], "plannedHostToolStepIds": ["fill_reply"], "requestedSkillSkipIntent": true, "sessionWorkingMemoryIncluded": false}}, {"step": 2, "type": "readiness", "output": {"reason": "no_business_fields", "status": "ready"}}, {"meta": {"model": "/data/models/Qwen3-32B-AWQ", "prompt": "<active_skill>\\n一、目标\\n基于评论内容（优先使用上下文已存在数据），对评论进行聚合分析，识别情感分布、主题关注点及差评原因。\\n\\n二、核心原则\\n数据优先级（从高到低）：\\n1. 当前上下文已存在评论列表（优先使用，不重复请求）\\n2. read-list 获取的数据\\n3. 用户显式提供的数据\\n\\n三、工作流\\n\\nStep 0：是否需要取数判断\\n- 如果上下文已有评论数据 → 直接使用，不调用 read-list\\n- 如果没有 → 才调用 @S02S1101 或者read-detail @S02S1102 \\n\\nStep 1：数据统一结构\\n[\\n  { \\"content\\": \\"\\" }\\n]\\n\\nStep 2：分析维度\\n1. 情感分类：positive / neutral / negative\\n2. 高频主题：\\n   - 商品质量\\n   - 商品功能\\n   - 商品外观\\n   - 包装\\n   - 物流\\n   - 客服服务\\n   - 售后服务\\n   - 价格\\n   - 其他\\n\\n3. 关注度排序（频率 + 负面权重）\\n\\n4. 差评分析：\\n   - 差评数量\\n   - 占比\\n   - 主要原因归类\\n   - 高频负面词\\n\\n5. 优点与问题总结\\n6. 可执行优化建议\\n\\n四、强约束规则\\n- 有上下文数据禁止重复调用 read-list\\n- 禁止重复分页请求\\n- 禁止编造数据\\n- 必须优先使用上下文数据\\n- 数据缺失才允许补拉\\n\\n五、输出结构\\n{\\n  \\"summary\\": \\"\\",\\n  \\"sentiment\\": {\\n    \\"positive\\": 0,\\n    \\"neutral\\": 0,\\n    \\"negative\\": 0\\n  },\\n  \\"topics\\": [],\\n  \\"negativeReasons\\": [],\\n  \\"advantages\\": [],\\n  \\"issues\\": [],\\n  \\"suggestions\\": []\\n}\\n\\n六、增强建议\\n- 增加 comments_source 字段（context / read-list）\\n- 用于链路追踪与缓存优化\\n</active_skill>\\n\\nYou are the tool decision module. Persona and scope come from <agent_prompt>; you only choose tools and parameters. Final user-facing wording is produced later by summarize — keep message content minimal when emitting tool_calls.\\nIf a tool is needed, use native tool_calls. If not needed, answer in message content with empty tool_calls.\\n\\nWhen <active_skill> is present, follow its tool discipline but still obey <current_objective> and observations.\\n\\nPlan mode (user message contains <current_objective>):\\n- Execute ONLY the current step objective; do not restart the full original request.\\n- <user_intent> holds the original request for parameter context only — not a reason to repeat completed steps.\\n- Match toolRole implied by the objective to <tool_schema> roles.\\n\\nOutput (native tool_calls):\\n- Need a tool → emit tool_calls.\\n- No tool needed → brief message content + empty tool_calls.\\n- Never emit NO_TOOL_REQUIRED / SELECT_TOOL / MISSING_FIELDS as plain text.\\n\\nObservations (split blocks):\\n- <working_memory_observations>: session GOA ledger — prior turns; background only.\\n- <current_run_observations>: tools executed in THIS run; primary source for the current step.\\n- Prefer current_run_observations when both blocks have the same tool+args; do not repeat successful current_run calls.\\n- READ: if required fields are already in current_run_observations → empty tool_calls; else check working_memory only when current_run is empty.\\n- summary.total alone is not a reason to re-fetch — check whether records already satisfy the filter.\\n\\nParameter sources (in priority order):\\n1. User frame: <current_objective> / <current_user_request> / <user_intent>\\n2. <current_run_observations>, then <working_memory_observations>\\n3. Session GOA blocks when present (full session snapshot, coverage=full_session_goa): <session_goa_coverage>, <recent_episodes>, <artifact_summaries>, <observation_inventory>, <active_task>, <session_entities>\\n- Never fabricate IDs, shop headers, or filters.\\n- Map conditions via <tool_schema> paramHints / inputSchema; missing required fields → ask concisely.\\n\\nTool choice (<tool_schema>):\\n- Select by decision role + resource + operation + filters + returns — not description text alone.\\n- Prefer the fewest tool calls that satisfy the current objective.\\n- optionalParamNames still exist for filtering when listed.\\n\\nWRITE (isMutation=true):\\n- When user_intent or objective specifies exact fixed text for a write param, pass verbatim — do not paraphrase.\\n- When a prior summarize step produced a draft reply in observations, use that text verbatim for the write body param — do not paraphrase or shorten.\\n- plan_compose_write and plan_draft_reply in observations are runtime artifacts — NEVER call them as tools; only bound tools in <tool_schema> are callable.\\n- PLAN COMPOSE_WRITE step (<current_objective> asks to compose parameters): emit exactly one bound write tool_call with identifiers, enums, and full reply body from read observations. Do NOT wait for plan_draft_reply; generating reply text in tool_call arguments is required.\\n- PLAN WRITE fallback step (only if present did not gate): call the bound write tool using plan_compose_write.arguments verbatim — do not invent new body text.\\n- Other write steps without compose payload: if no draft exists in observations and objective is submit/write, emit empty tool_calls (runtime will retry) — do not invent reply text.\\n- Call only when all businessFields are satisfied; never claim success without tool_calls.", "toolSchema": "[{\\"name\\":\\"S02S1101\\",\\"description\\":\\"支持查询主站和亚马逊(AMAZON)的评论数据，按查询条件（时间、评分、商品/订单标识、评价状态等）分页获取商品评论列表，返回多条记录及评论 content。用于评论检索、统计与分析取数；单条详情或回复提交请用其他工具。\\",\\"role\\":\\"read-list\\",\\"resource\\":\\"PRODUCT\\",\\"operation\\":\\"LIST\\",\\"filters\\":[\\"brand\\",\\"complaintType\\",\\"countdown\\",\\"endTime\\",\\"frontCategoryId\\",\\"isPublic\\",\\"itemId\\",\\"orderId\\",\\"processStatus\\",\\"reviewMediaType\\",\\"reviewStatus\\",\\"reviewType\\",\\"scenes\\",\\"score\\",\\"sku\\",\\"startTime\\"],\\"returns\\":[\\"记录唯一标识\\",\\"标题\\",\\"类型\\",\\"评论内容\\",\\"itemId\\",\\"orderId\\",\\"content\\",\\"item Id\\",\\"seo Url\\",\\"images\\"],\\"isMutation\\":false,\\"requiredParams\\":[\\"X-SHOP-ID\\"],\\"paramHints\\":[{\\"param\\":\\"brand\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 品牌\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"complaintType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 客诉类型\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"countdown\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); 搜置倒计时\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"endTime\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64(毫秒级时间戳格式)); 结束时间-时间戳格式\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"frontCategoryId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64); 前台类目\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"isPublic\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=boolean; 公开状态\\",\\"example\\":\\"false\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"itemId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; itemId\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"orderId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 订单号，订单ID,订单编号\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"page\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); Page number\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"processStatus\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 客诉处理状态\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewMediaType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 评价的媒体类型\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewStatus\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 评价状态\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string(A_PREMIUM-主站，AMAZON-亚马逊); 评价所属的平台， A_PREMIUM-主站，AMAZON-亚马逊\\"},{\\"par