media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/reviewddec597e70454030b1348fac0a629e68_width_526_height_766.png", "type": "IMAGE", "order": 1, "scenes": null}, {"url": "https://dev-media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/review4bcc1fc63287474287d2c7f3ef41d6bd_width_577_height_569.png", "type": "IMAGE", "order": 2, "scenes": null}], "content": "\\n\\n又是两家合股，傅作义派的是第35军，蒋介石派的是第16军，正经涿州南下。这里面发生了一个问题，究竟他们要不要北平？现在北平这样的空虚。总之，整个蒋介石的北方战线，整个傅作义系统，大概只有几个月就要完蛋，他们还在那里做石家庄的梦。\\n最近常有人叽叽喳喳，拿我来开心，说什么徐州是京沪的大门，应当派一员虎将来坐镇，派不出一只虎，也要派一只狗，最后派了一只猪来。这话实在是恭维我啦。古今征战，猪的战术一再为人们成功运用着，遇有攻击便把屁股偎依着墙壁，让你抓不着尾巴，终于把他它无可奈何，弄不好尖牙利齿给你一口，咬住了就不放。\\n", "visible": true, "nickName": "Vincent", "reviewTime": "2025-04-30T07:37:17.885853Z", "reviewStatus": "ON_SHOW"}, "complaintType": "", "processStatus": "PROCESSED", "checkoutOrderId": 3486435023727017, "complaintCategory": ""}, {"id": "43318", "sku": "USACC29069-C", "email": null, "score": 4, "title": "test", "images": [], "itemId": "102619387315843087", "remark": null, "seoUrl": "yt-a-premium-ac-compressor-c0a6581a-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b", "content": "4纵11纵加两个独立师强化塔山防线；23789五个纵队，加6纵17师，包打锦州；10纵加一个师在黑山大虎山一线阻击廖耀湘兵团；12纵加12个独立师围困长春；5纵6纵两个师监视沈阳；1纵做总预备队。重复一遍！", "orderId": "US20250329ba6c3f69000010", "visible": false, "editLink": "NDMzMTgmMjAyMiYxNTE0MTIzMTM4OTAyMzM0MTM=", "hasImage": false, "hasVideo": false, "nickName": "Durant", "countdown": null, "itemImage": "https://media.cdn.a-premium.com/2022/item/image/ACC/USACC29069-C/USACC29069-C-20231226-0_width_1600_height_1600.jpg", "itemTitle": "- | A-Premium.com", "reviewTime": "2025-04-22T01:15:05Z", "gmtModified": "2026-01-19T08:57:04Z", "reviewReply": null, "reviewStatus": "DELETE", "updateReview": null, "complaintType": "", "processStatus": "PROCESSED", "checkoutOrderId": 3486436037357022, "complaintCategory": ""}, {"id": "43317", "sku": "USALT82720", "email": null, "score": 5, "title": "very good!!!", "images": [], "itemId": "10182343109170814", "remark": null, "seoUrl": "yt-a-premium-alter