90cb-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b", "reviewTime": "2025-12-29T09:46:48Z", "gmtModified": "2026-01-19T08:57:04Z", "reviewReply": null, "reviewStatus": "DELETE", "updateReview": null, "complaintType": "", "processStatus": "PROCESSED", "checkoutOrderId": 3534002205305068, "complaintCategory": ""}, {"id": "43586", "sku": "USACC29075-C", "email": "lsq1085030805@outlook.com", "score": 5, "title": "1", "images": [], "itemId": "92797018300560404", "remark": null, "seoUrl": "yt-a-premium-ac-compressor-c07dc619-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b", "content": "1", "orderId": "US2025122957df7ce8000017", "visible": true, "editLink": "NDM1ODYmMjAyMiYxNDIzNzAyMzUyMDYwNjQxMjg=", "hasImage": false, "hasVideo": false, "nickName": "123123123123123123", "countdown": null, "itemImage": "https://yt-prod-media-assets.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/2022/item/image/ACC/USACC29075-C/USACC29075-C-20240115-0_width_1600_height_1600.jpg", "itemTitle": "- | A-Premium.com", "reviewTime": "2025-12-29T06:49:25Z", "gmtModified": "2026-01-19T08:57:04Z", "reviewReply": null, "reviewStatus": null, "updateReview": null, "complaintType": "", "processStatus": "PROCESSED", "checkoutOrderId": 3533981664209038, "complaintCategory": ""}], "total": 895}}, {"step": 76, "type": "result_check", "output": {"phase": "post_tools", "route": "llm", "reason": "continue_decision_loop", "planSyncedAt": null, "taskPlanStep": null, "planAbortedEmpty": false, "planAdvanceRoute": null, "planAdvanceReason": null, "duplicateSkipCount": 0, "planRouteAuthority": "react", "pendingToolCallCount": 0, "planAbortedDuplicate": false, "planAbortedSameArgsRepeat": false, "planAbortedTerminalToolError": false, "planAbortedToolStepExhausted": false, "planAbortedWriteStepExhausted": false, "supersededPendingToolCallCount": 0, "planSupersededPendingToolCallCount": 0}}, {"meta": {"model": "/data/models/Qwen3-32B-AWQ", "prompt": "You are the tool decision module. Persona and scope come from <agent_prompt>; you only choose tools and parameters. Final user-facing wording is produced later by summarize — keep message content minimal when emitting tool_calls.\\nIf a tool is needed, use native tool_calls. If not needed, answer in message content with empty tool_calls.\\n\\nWhen <active_skill> is present, follow its tool discipline but still obey <current_objective> and observations.\\n\\nPlan mode (user message contains <current_objective>):\\n- Execute ONLY the current step objective; do not restart the full original request.\\n- <user_intent> holds the original request for parameter context only — not a reason to repeat completed steps.\\n- Match toolRole implied by the objective to <tool_schema> roles.\\n\\nOutput (native tool_calls):\\n- Need a tool → emit tool_calls.\\n- No tool needed → brief message content + empty tool_calls.\\n- Never emit NO_TOOL_REQUIRED / SELECT_TOOL / MISSING_FIELDS as plain text.\\n\\nObservations (split blocks):\\n- <working_memory_observations>: session GOA ledger — prior turns; background only.\\n- <current_run_observations>: tools executed in THIS run; primary source for the current step.\\n- Prefer current_run_observations when both blocks have the same tool+args; do not repeat successful current_run calls.\\n- READ: if required fields are already in current_run_observations → empty tool_calls; else check working_memory only when current_run is empty.\\n- summary.total alone is not a reason to re-fetch — check whether records already satisfy the filter.\\n\\nParameter sources (in priority order):\\n1. User frame: <current_objective> / <current_user_request> / <user_intent>\\n2. <current_run_observations>, then <working_memory_observations>\\n3. Session GOA blocks when present (full session snapshot, coverage=full_session_goa): <session_goa_coverage>, <recent_episodes>, <artifact_summaries>, <observation_inventory>, <active_task>, <session_entities>\\n- Never fabricate IDs, shop headers, or filters.\\n- Map conditions via <tool_schema> paramHints / inputSchema; missing required fields → ask concisely.\\n\\nTool choice (<tool_schema>):\\n- Select by decision role + resource + operation + filters + returns — not description text alone.\\n- Prefer the fewest tool calls that satisfy the current objective.\\n- optionalParamNames still exist for filtering when listed.\\n\\nWRITE (isMutation=true):\\n- When user_intent or objective specifies exact fixed text for a write param, pass verbatim — do not paraphrase.\\n- When a prior summarize step produced a draft reply in observations, use that text verbatim for the write body param — do not paraphrase or shorten.\\n- plan_compose_write and plan_draft_reply in observations are runtime artifacts — NEVER call them as tools; only bound tools in <tool_schema> are callable.\\n- PLAN COMPOSE_WRITE step (<current_objective> asks to compose parameters): emit exactly one bound write tool_call with identifiers, enums, and full reply body from read observations. Do NOT wait for plan_draft_reply; generating reply text in tool_call arguments is required.\\n- PLAN WRITE fallback step (only if present did not gate): call the bound write tool using plan_compose_write.arguments verbatim — do not invent new body text.\\n- Other write steps without compose payload: if no draft exists in observations and objective is submit/write, emit empty tool_calls (runtime will retry) — do not invent reply text.\\n- Call only when all businessFields are satisfied; never claim success without tool_calls.", "toolSchema": "[{\\"name\\":\\"S02S1102\\",\\"description\\":\\"通过评论Id、reviewId 获取评价的详情内容信息\\",\\"role\\":\\"read-detail\\",\\"resource\\":\\"UNKNOWN\\",\\"operation\\":\\"DETAIL\\",\\"returns\\":[\\"记录唯一标识\\",\\"标题\\",\\"业务状态\\",\\"评论内容\\",\\"评论时间\\",\\"用户邮箱\\",\\"sku\\",\\"商品ID\\"],\\"businessFields\\":[\\"reviewId\\"],\\"isMutation\\":false,\\"requiredParams\\":[\\"X-SHOP-ID\\",\\"reviewId\\"],\\"paramHints\\":[{\\"param\\":\\"X-SHOP-ID\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=header; required; type=integer(int64); X-SHOP-ID\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=path; required; type=integer(int64); reviewId\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"}]},{\\"name\\":\\"S02S1101\\",\\"description\\":\\"支持查询主站和亚马逊(AMAZON)的评论数据，按查询条件（时间、评分、商品/订单标识、评价状态等）分页获取商品评论列表，返回多条记录及评论 content。用于评论检索、统计与分析取数；单条详情或回复提交请用其他工具。\\",\\"role\\":\\"read-list\\",\\"resource\\":\\"PRODUCT\\",\\"operation\\":\\"LIST\\",\\"filters\\":[\\"brand\\",\\"complaintType\\",\\"countdown\\",\\"endTime\\",\\"frontCategoryId\\",\\"isPublic\\",\\"itemId\\",\\"orderId\\",\\"processStatus\\",\\"reviewMediaType\\",\\"reviewStatus\\",\\"reviewType\\",\\"scenes\\",\\"score\\",\\"sku\\",\\"startTime\\"],\\"returns\\":[\\"记录唯一标识\\",\\"标题\\",\\"类型\\",\\"评论内容\\",\\"itemId\\",\\"orderId\\",\\"content\\",\\"item Id\\",\\"seo Url\\",\\"images\\"],\\"isMutation\\":false,\\"requiredParams\\":[\\"X-SHOP-ID\\"],\\"paramHints\\":[{\\"param\\":\\"brand\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 品牌\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"complaintType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 客诉类型\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"countdown\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); 搜置倒计时\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"endTime\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64(毫秒级时间戳格式)); 结束时间-时间戳格式\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"frontCategoryId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64); 前台类目\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"isPublic\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=boolean; 公开状态\\",\\"example\\":\\"false\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"itemId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; itemId\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"orderId\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 订单号，订单ID,订单编号\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"page\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); Page number\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"processStatus\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 客诉处理状态\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewMediaType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 评价的媒体类型\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewStatus\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; 评价状态\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"reviewType\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string(A_PREMIUM-主站，AMAZON-亚马逊); 评价所属的平台， A_PREMIUM-主站，AMAZON-亚马逊\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"scenes\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=array; 媒体上架场景\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"score\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); 星数\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"size\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int32); Page size\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"sku\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=string; SKU\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"startTime\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=query; type=integer(int64(毫秒级时间戳格式)); 开始时间-时间戳格式\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"},{\\"param\\":\\"X-SHOP-ID\\",\\"hint\\":\\"in=header; required; type=integer(int64); X-SHOP-ID\\",\\"example\\":\\"1\\"}]}]", "agentPrompt": "<agent_prompt>\\n评论分析助手\\n你是一名专业的评论分析助手，负责分析商品评论数据，为运营、客服和商品团队提供决策支持，并且支持按照客服的要求，实现对评论的回复。\\n站点规则\\n默认站点：US\\nUS → X-SHOP-ID = 2022\\nCA → X-SHOP-ID = 2023\\n用户未指定站点时，默认使用 US（2022）\\n当用户提及 CA、Canada、加拿大站时，使用 CA（2023）\\n查询规则\\n获取评论列表时：\\n用户明确指定分页或条数时，以用户输入为准，\\n分析目标\\n基于评论内容进行分析：\\n情感分布（正面 / 中性 / 负面）\\n核心主题（质量、物流、包装、价格、服务、功能等）\\n高频问题与用户关注点\\n差评原因归类\\n潜在风险（投诉、退款、舆情风险等）\\n用户真实需求与反馈\\n分析原则\\n仅依据评论内容分析\\n不编造数据、结论或原因\\n优先归纳共性问题\\n优先识别高频负面问题\\n优先发现异常趋势\\n建议必须具体且可执行\\n输出要求\\n按以下结构输出：\\n\\n结论摘要\\n\\n概括评论整体情况、情感分布及主要发现。\\n\\n问题分析\\n高频主题\\n差评原因\\n用户关注点\\n风险分析\\n优化建议\\n\\n针对发现的问题给出具体改进建议。\\n\\n输出保持专业、客观、简洁。\\n</agent_prompt>", "userRequest": "评论分析、评论统计、差评分析、差评原因、差评归因、评论构成、情感分析、评论报告、数据洞察。先按用户筛选条件调用评论列表取数，例如帮我查询xxx的评论数据在进行分析，再基于 content 解读构成、评分分布与差评原因。适用：分析、统计、报告、洞察类请求；不适用：回复、回评、remark 提交", "observations": "Answer the latest request from current_run_observations first; working_memory_observations is session context only.\\n<working_memory_observations>\\n[]\\n</working_memory_observations>\\n<current_run_observations>\\n[{\\"tool\\":\\"S02S1101\\",\\"executed\\":true,\\"reuseNote\\":\\"This tool already succeeded with the args shown. Do not call it again with the same arguments; answer from this observation.\\",\\"success\\":true,\\"summary\\":{\\"matchedCount\\":610,\\"mapReduce\\":true,\\"complete\\":false,\\"map