20K-C/USTF00120K-C-20231226-0_width_1600_height_1600.jpg\\",\\"sku\\":\\"USTF00120K-C\\",\\"nickName\\":\\"tongx\\",\\"reviewTime\\":\\"2025-07-15T12:21:45Z\\",\\"visible\\":true,\\"hasImage\\":false,\\"hasVideo\\":false,\\"score\\":3,\\"reviewStatus\\":null,\\"checkoutOrderId\\":3505143964621102,\\"orderId\\":\\"US2025071557ef6186000045\\",\\"email\\":null,\\"editLink\\":\\"NDM0MTgmMjAyMiYxNTU4NTA4NDA0NjgxMTM5Mzg=\\",\\"reviewReply\\":null,\\"updateReview\\":null,\\"remark\\":null,\\"complaintType\\":\\"\\",\\"complaintCategory\\":\\"\\",\\"processStatus\\":\\"PROCESSED\\",\\"countdown\\":null,\\"gmtModified\\":\\"2026-01-19T08:57:04Z\\"},{\\"id\\":\\"43417\\",\\"title\\":\\"excellent experience\\",\\"content\\":\\"I wanted to say what a excellent experience it was! I ordered the wrong pair from the big A and they ended up never being sent to me. I ordered these on a Sunday night and the were at my door on Tuesday and installed on Wednesday morning. I went to the mechanic shop and they couldn't find the directions in the box and I called customer service and they sent me the install booklet my PDF in an email in 5 minutes and gave them to the mechanic. Turns out the manual was in the box they didn't see them! An A plus experience all around and they look great and I love them . Thank you for your excellent experience and customer service.\\",\\"itemId\\":\\"102619299269013300\\",\\"seoUrl\\":\\"yt-a-premium-fuel-pump-c0a1569d-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b-wilson-test\\",\\"images\\":[{\\"url\\":\\"https://dev-media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/reviewc3f6ef495e824aa0af6db02af8315e86_width_0_height_0.png\\",\\"type\\":\\"IMAGE\\",\\"order\\":1,\\"scenes\\":null},{\\"url\\":\\"https://dev-media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/reviewd0195f1e2c404ef89296b256af75c3eb_width_0_height_0.png\\",\\"type\\":\\"IMAGE\\",\\"order\\":2,\\"scenes\\":null},{\\"url\\":\\"https://dev-media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/revieweed1b338274