rl": "https://admin.a-premium-test.com/item/seller/review/list?page=19&size=20", "method": "Get", "baseUrl": "https://admin.a-premium-test.com/item", "parameters": {"body": {}, "path": {}, "query": {"page": 19, "size": 20}, "header": {"X-SHOP-ID": 2022}}, "pathTemplate": "/seller/review/list", "resolvedPath": "/seller/review/list"}, "llmArguments": {"page": 19, "size": 20, "X-SHOP-ID": 2022}, "responseSource": "{\\"total\\":895,\\"data\\":[{\\"id\\":\\"43320\\",\\"title\\":\\"14142\\",\\"content\\":\\"423423423423\\",\\"itemId\\":\\"3312283073655213\\",\\"seoUrl\\":\\"yt-a-premium-brake-caliper-bddf9a5e-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b\\",\\"images\\":[],\\"itemTitle\\":\\"999, 1-PC Brake Caliper, Front Left Driver Side, with Hardware, 4 Pistons, A-Premium newaces3307346008748034\\",\\"itemImage\\":\\"https://yt-prod-media-assets.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/2022/item/image/BC/USBCN91893/USBCN91893-0510-1-main_width_1600_height_1600.jpg\\",\\"sku\\":\\"USBCN91893\\",\\"nickName\\":\\"钱2423\\",\\"reviewTime\\":\\"2025-05-07T06:44:47Z\\",\\"visible\\":true,\\"hasImage\\":false,\\"hasVideo\\":false,\\"score\\":5,\\"reviewStatus\\":null,\\"checkoutOrderId\\":3493200366667035,\\"orderId\\":\\"US20250507b2e80d19000020\\",\\"email\\":null,\\"editLink\\":\\"NDMzMjAmMjAyMiYxODgxOTUwNzMwOTA3ODgzNDE=\\",\\"reviewReply\\":null,\\"updateReview\\":null,\\"remark\\":null,\\"complaintType\\":\\"\\",\\"complaintCategory\\":\\"\\",\\"processStatus\\":\\"PROCESSED\\",\\"countdown\\":null,\\"gmtModified\\":\\"2026-01-19T08:57:04Z\\"},{\\"id\\":\\"43319\\",\\"title\\":\\"Just soso\\",\\"content\\":\\"最近常有人叽叽喳喳，拿我来开心，说什么徐州是京沪的大门，应当派一员虎将来坐镇，派不出一只虎，也要派一只狗，最后派了一只猪来。这话实在是恭维我啦。古今征战，猪的战术一再为人们成功运用着，遇有攻击便把屁股偎依着墙壁，让你抓不着尾巴，终于把他它无可奈何，弄不好尖牙利齿给你一口，咬住了就不放。\\\\n\\",\\"itemId\\":\\"8456086231229134\\",\\"seoUrl\\":\\"yt-a-premium-ignition-coils-spark-plugs-kits-bee063f4-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b\\",\\"images\\":[{\\"url\\":\\"https://dev-media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/reviewddec597e70454030b1348fac0a629e68_width_526_height_766.png\\",\\"type\\":\\"IMAGE\\",\\"order\\":1,\\"scenes\\":null}],\\"itemTitle\\":\\"A-Premium bee063f4-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b Ignition Coils & Spark Plugs Kitslxsgy -custom2\\",\\"itemImage\\":\\"https://media.cdn.a-premium.com/2022/item/image/ICK/USICK77100-4/USICK77100-4-0406-2-ICK77100-4_width_1600_height_1600.jpg\\",\\"sku\\":\\"USICK77100-4\\",\\"nickName\\":\\"Vincent\\",\\"reviewTime\\":\\"2025-04-30T06:48:43Z\\",\\"visible\\":true,\\"hasImage\\":true,\\"hasVideo\\":false,\\"score\\":3,\\"reviewStatus\\":\\"UPDATE\\",\\"checkoutOrderId\\":3486435023727017,\\"orderId\\":\\"US202503295097b14200000c\\",\\"email\\":null,\\"editLink\\":\\"NDMzMTkmMjAyMiYxNTE0MTIzMTM4OTAyMzM0MTM=\\",\\"reviewReply\\":null,\\"updateReview\\":{\\"id\\":\\"43319\\",\\"title\\":\\"Just Good Good\\",\\"content\\":\\"\\\\n\\\\n又是两家合股，傅作义派的是第35军，蒋介石派的是第16军，正经涿州南下。这里面发生了一个问题，究竟他们要不要北平？现在北平这样的空虚。总之，整个蒋介石的北方战线，整个傅作义系统，大概只有几个月就要完蛋，他们还在那里做石家庄的梦。\\\\n最近常有人叽叽喳喳，拿我来开心，说什么徐州是京沪的大门，应当派一员虎将来坐镇，派不出一只虎，也要派一只狗，最后派了一只猪来。这话实在是恭维我啦。古今征战，猪的战术一再为人们成功运用着，遇有攻击便把屁股偎依着墙壁，让你抓不着尾巴，终于把他它无可奈何，弄不好尖牙利齿给你一口，咬住了就不放。\\\\n\\",\\"score\\":4,\\"nickName\\":\\"Vincent\\",\\"reviewTime\\":\\"2025-04-30T07:37:17.885853Z\\",\\"reviewStatus\\":\\"ON_SHOW\\",\\"visible\\":true,\\"images\\":[{\\"url\\":\\"https://dev-media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/reviewddec597e70454030b1348fac0a629e68_width_526_height_766.png\\",\\"type\\":\\"IMAGE\\",\\"order\\":1,\\"scenes\\":null},{\\"url\\":\\"https://dev-media-assets.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/999item/review4bcc1fc63287474287d2c7f3ef41d6bd_width_577_height_569.png\\",\\"type\\":\\"IMAGE\\",\\"order\\":2,\\"scenes\\":null}]},\\"remark\\":null,\\"complaintType\\":\\"\\",\\"complaintCategory\\":\\"\\",\\"processStatus\\":\\"PROCESSED\\",\\"countdown\\":null,\\"gmtModified\\":\\"2026-01-19T08:57:04Z\\"},{\\"id\\":\\"43318\\",\\"title\\":\\"test\\",\\"content\\":\\"4纵11纵加两个独立师强化塔山防线；23789五个纵队，加6纵17师，包打锦州；10纵加一个师在黑山大虎山一线阻击廖耀湘兵团；12纵加12个独立师围困长春；5纵6纵两个师监视沈阳；1纵做总预备队。重复一遍！\\",\\"itemId\\":\\"102619387315843087\\",\\"seoUrl\\":\\"yt-a-premium-ac-compressor-c0a6581a-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b\\",\\"images\\":[],\\"itemTitle\\":\\"- | A-Premium.com\\",\\"itemImage\\":\\"https://media.cdn.a-premium.com/2022/item/image/ACC/USACC29069-C/USACC29069-C-20231226-0_width_1600_height_1600.jpg\\",\\"sku\\":\\"USACC29069-C\\",\\"nickName\\":\\"Durant\\",\\"reviewTime\\":\\"2025-04-22T01:15:05Z\\",\\"visible\\":false,\\"hasImage\\":false,\\"hasVideo\\":false,\\"score\\":4,\\"reviewStatus\\":\\"DELETE\\",\\"checkoutOrderId\\":3486436037357022,\\"orderId\\":\\"US20250329ba6c3f69000010\\",\\"email\\":null,\\"editLink\\":\\"NDMzMTgmMjAyMiYxNTE0MTIzMTM4OTAyMzM0MTM=\\",\\"reviewReply\\":null,\\"updateReview\\":null,\\"remark\\":null,\\"complaintType\\":\\"\\",\\"complaintCategory\\":\\"\\",\\"processStatus\\":\\"PROCESSED\\",\\"countdown\\":null,\\"gmtModified\\":\\"2026-01-19T08:57:04Z\\"},{\\"id\\":\\"43317\\",\\"title\\":\\"very good!!!\\",\\"content\\":\\"我讲过，抗日战争快不得，解放战争拖不得。现在看来，这个话，没有错。照一般规律，总兵力和装备不超过对方，绝不可进入战略决战。也不尽然。解放战争两年多，我们滚大了，我们打精了，我们积累了有利决战的条件。好比凹凸镜，向着炎炎的烈日，百倍、千倍的光度聚合到一点上，白热化了，冒烟了，不能不燃烧了！\\",\\"itemId\\":\\"10182343109170814\\",\\"seoUrl\\":\\"yt-a-premium-alternator-bf0bfe2d-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b\\",\\"images\\":[],\\"itemTitle\\":\\"CATETEST, Alternatorvrrtg, -Groove Pulley, A-Premium bf0bfe2d-e9c4-11ef-ae44-0696bbbf336b\\",\\"itemImage\\":\\"https://media.cdn.a-premium.com/2022/item/image/ALT/USALT82720/USALT82720-1-main_width_1600_height_1600.jpg\\",\\"sku\\":\\"USALT82720\\",\\"nickName\\":\\"Durant\\",\\"reviewTime\\":\\"2025-04-22T00:57:22Z\\",\\"visible\\":true,\\"hasImage\\":false,\\"hasVideo\\":false,\\"score\\":5,\\"reviewStatus\\":null,\\"checkoutOrderId\\":3486436037357022,\\"orderId\\":\\"US20250329ba6c3f69000010\\",\\"email\\":null,\\"editLink\\":\\"NDMzMTcmMjAyMiYxNTE0MTIzMTM4OTAyMzM0MTM=\\",\\"reviewReply\\":null,\\"updateReview\\":null,\\"remark\\":null,\\"complaintType\\":